  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How it is formed",
     "texto": [
      "**aver** or **essere** in the infinitive + past participle: **aver capito** (to have understood), **essere tornato** (to have come back).",
      "It is used with **dopo**: **Dopo aver capito, ho deciso** (after having understood, I decided)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement",
     "texto": [
      "With **essere**, the participle agrees with the subject: **dopo essere tornata** (after she had come back). With **avere** it does not change.",
      "This way you avoid repeating the subject."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Form",
